### Upload QrToBundle.map to matchbox and run it, e.g. with the VS Code REST Client

@host = https://test.ahdis.ch/matchbox/fhir

### 1. POST QrToBundle.map
POST {{host}}/StructureMap HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+xml;fhirVersion=4.0
Content-Type: text/fhir-mapping

< ./QrToBundle.map


### 2. Transform a QuestionnaireResponse to a CH ELM document Bundle
POST {{host}}/StructureMap/$transform?source=http://fhir.ch/ig/ch-elm/StructureMap/QrToBundle
Accept: application/fhir+json;fhirVersion=4.0
Content-Type: application/fhir+json;fhirVersion=4.0

< ./qr-example.json
